        "synth_step_1": "type\": \"synthesis",
        "name": "FTO glass cleaning",
        "procedure": "Slabs of FTO-coated glass with planar sizes of 1.5 cm × 2.5 cm were used as substrates, which were cleaned beforehand in acetone, ethanol, and distilled water successively under sonication for 20 min before drying at 60 °C.",
