        "characterization_summary": "Pristine tungsten oxide film shows uniform and dense surface with closely packed coral-like structures in 200-400 nm size range; thickness ~300 nm.",
        "evidence_snippet": "Morphologically, the pristine uncolored film on FTO glass shows a rather uniform and dense surface in the top-view SEM images... thickness of the sputtered film over FTO glass is estimated to be around 300 nm, as measured from the cross-sectional SEM image (Fig. 1b)."
      },
      {
